notes.content:
The demo is now available! It is limited to the entertainment mode for play and provides most of the gaming experience of playing an emperor in the first generation.
More features can be experienced in the EA version:

https://store.steampowered.com/app/2716930/_/

[h2]More contents included in the EA version 0.31:[/h2]
[list]
[*] Standard mode;
[*] Prince cultivation;
[*] Successive inheritance;
[*] Alchemy system;
[*] Army long-distance travel and land reclamation;
[*] Encountering concubines in the imperial garden;
[*] Better and more concubines' illustrations.
[/list]
